## 14. Run an OS command on an agent (syscollector example)

> Requires command module to be enabled and allowed.

```bash
AGENT_ID="001"  # change to your agent ID

curl -k -X POST \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "command": "syscollector",
    "arguments": ["--help"],
    "wait_for_complete": true
  }' \
  "$WAZUH_API/agents/$AGENT_ID/command" | jq
```

